<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202" title="View the profile of xaanru">xaanru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 116<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m not a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15795#msg15795"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15795#msg15795">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2625 on:</b> March 28, 2005, 08:08:44 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">conv. they do qvic some days and some days they dont have right classes online &lt; it seams&gt;</div><br />A more accurate description would be: conviction kills everything in qvic, whenever they feel like it, but sometimes decide to raid other targets.<br /><br />The only time classes matter all that much for qvic, is for the little 1-2 group after hours mini raids. For those, a bard kind of makes life easier.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15796"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=813" title="View the profile of Justyse">Justyse</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 89<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img216.exs.cx/img216/6516/convicavat44as.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My pirate friggen retired! WTF?!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=813"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.convictioneq.com/forums" title="&lt;Conviction&gt;" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:tribeof3@shentel.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15796#msg15796"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15796#msg15796">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2626 on:</b> March 28, 2005, 09:30:42 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">conv. they do qvic some days and some days they dont have right classes online &lt; it seams&gt;</div><br />Conviction currently raids monday - friday, with tuesdays slated for Time (however last tuesday the servers went down in the middle of it  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" /> ), we also do Inktuta, Riftseekers, RCoD named, and occasional epics.<br />We took a few days off for the fabled junk.<br />But we havent called a raid off for lack of players/classes in many, many months.<br />Our last couple of Inktuta runs we&#039;ve had a full 54 on the expedition, so we definately arent having a problem with not having the right classes online.  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm9.gif" alt="cwm9" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635046" target="_blank"><img src="http://img223.echo.cx/img223/4647/justygl35tk.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15805"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=486" title="View the profile of Bobo">Bobo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 72<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/weasel.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
