							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15805#msg15805"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15805#msg15805">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2627 on:</b> March 28, 2005, 03:07:24 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15792#msg15792">Quote from: anabesi on March 27, 2005, 10:58:31 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Have to agree with the drood on this one RN server is the problem. Havent seen so many undermotivated folks ever on one server. Come on now they handed you guys free loot  with the DoN xpansion and no one has killed the 2nd dragon yet ? <br /></div><br />Yea we are just a big bunch of slackers, maybe we could claim better if we server transferred...  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm34.gif" alt="cwm34" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
